  "data": {
    "ruleType": "army-rule",
    "summary": "With **ADEPTA SORORITAS** as your [Army Faction](vsdata:core-rule/select-army-faction), each of your units that has **Acts of Faith** may use it once per phase by spending a Miracle die.\n\nYou gain 1 Miracle die:\n\n- as every turn starts\n- whenever an **ADEPTA SORORITAS** unit of yours is destroyed\n\nRoll a D6 for each die gained and keep it in your pool at that value, which stays fixed unless a rule permits a change or re-roll.\n\nBefore the unit or one of its models makes an [Advance](vsdata:core-rule/advance-move), [Battle-shock](vsdata:core-rule/battle-shock), [Charge](vsdata:core-rule/charge-phase), Damage, Hit, saving throw or [Wound](vsdata:core-rule/wound-rolls) roll, you may substitute a saved die:\n\n- Even on a multiple-dice roll, replace only 1 die and roll the others normally.\n- The substituted value counts as unmodified.\n- Remove the spent die from the pool.\n\nFor example, spending a stored 4 changes a 2D6 [Battle-shock](vsdata:core-rule/battle-shock) test to D6+4.",
